  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EGPS-2 World Bank trust fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EGPS (Extractive Global Programmatic Support) is a World Bank multi-donor trust fund supported by Canada, UK, EU, Norway and six other states, The main component is to support implementation of EITI (Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative). The objective for EGPS is to support to authorities in regulation of the petroleum and mining industry, particulary related to transparency. The annual budget is approximately USD 10 million and Norways contribution approximately 10%.</narrative>
  </description>
